* lna-a2-common-gate: common-gate NMOS input stage with current-reuse PMOS push-pull.
C C4 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n1 VSS n2 VSS  ; Common-gate: gate grounded (VSS), source at VIN1 via C4
C C1 n1 n3
PMOS PM1 n2 n3 VDD VDD
L L2 n2 n4
C C2 n4 VSS
C C3 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n5
NMOS NM3 n5 n5 VSS VSS
R R2 n5 n1
PMOS PM2 n6 n6 VDD VDD
R R4 n6 VSS
R R5 n6 n3